01:05:30.760 --> 01:05:31.921
Now!


01:05:51.406 --> 01:05:53.147
<i>Zach, come on, same team!</i>


01:05:53.199 --> 01:05:54.109
My bad.


01:05:54.159 --> 01:05:56.070
